   {
    "id": "18037161872856086",
    "text": "🚨 ABSOLUTELY DISGRACEFUL, @ryanair! 🚨\n\nFlight FR5491, Fuerteventura–Madrid, 19/06/2026. Over 18 HOURS of delay due to a technical failure. I was forced to SPEND THE NIGHT SLEEPING ON THE AIRPORT FLOOR, with no hotel accommodation provided, and had to buy another flight ticket just to get to work.\n\nFIVE MONTHS LATER, I am STILL fighting for my passenger rights without a satisfactory resolution!\n\nIs this how Ryanair treats its passengers? What about compliance with EU Regulation 261/2004?\n\nI demand a proper response, the compensation I am legally entitled to, and reimbursement of the expenses claimed.\n\nPASSENGER RIGHTS ARE NOT OPTIONAL!\n\n#Ryanair #PassengerRights #EU261 #FlightDelay #AESA",
